            <div xml:id="d52">

                <pb facs="0210" n="44" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg44"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 813.00/876</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Fletcher to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-09-14T11:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 14, 1917, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>433. Your number 431, September 6, 3 p.m. Mexican Government has been asked to be
                    represented at conference, and at a Cabinet meeting day before yesterday it was
                    decided to accept the invitation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fletcher</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
